      "title": "University",
      "description": "University at Albany::: New Jobs http://albany.interviewexchange.com/ New job postings from University at Albany en-us Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:15:25 -0400 Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:15:25 -0400 http://blogs.law.harvard.edu/tech/rss IE JSP-RSS info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) Academic Advisor - Academic Support Center - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200691 Professional Academic Support Center - 02005 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue May 19 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The University at Albany has implemented a campus wide student success model aligning current advising structures, strengthening campus coordination and collaboration, and providing holistic and personalized support for students from admission to graduation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In furtherance of this mission, the Academic Support Center at the University at Albany is seeking innovative and student-centered academic advisors to support the University's student success model. University advisors are responsible for providing academic advisement to approximately 300 undergraduate students throughout ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200691\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200691 Adjunct Instructor for BMGT 341, Behavioral Foundations of Management - School of Business - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203520 Faculty Dean's Office--School of Business - 02201 Academic / Faculty Part-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Massry School of Business is seeking a qualified adjunct instructor to teach (1) section of BMGT 341 (Behavioral Foundations of Management) during the fall 2026 semester.&nbsp; Course details are below.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>BMGT 341 (Behavioral Foundations of Management) - 3 credit</li><li>Modality: In Person / On Campus</li><li>Meeting Day/Time: Monday/Wednesday evening sessions or Tuesday/Thursday morning sessions.</li><li>Semester Length: 8/24/26-12/7/26</li><li>Enrollment: Approximately 75-80 students</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This foundational 3 credit course is required for all Business Admini...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203520\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203520 Adjunct Instructor, Nursing - College of Integrated Health Sciences (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203843 Faculty College of Integrated Health Sciences - 02407 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 18 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Nursing Program within the College of Integrated Health Sciences at the University at Albany is a rapidly growing pre-licensure nursing program.&nbsp;The program is distinguished by its emphasis on immersive, clinically integrated education beginning in the first semester and prepares students for professional nursing practice through innovative classroom, laboratory, simulation, and clinical experiences. The program incorporates advanced educational technologies, interdisciplinary collaboration, and student-centered support systems to promote academic success, clinical reasoning, an...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203843\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203843 Adjunct Lecturer - Cybersecurity (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199953 Faculty Cybersecurity - 04042 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security and Cybersecurity (CEHC) is the first of its kind in the nation; uniting people, technology and knowledge to address the challenges of the 21st century. The Emerging Technology and Entrepreneurship Complex (ETEC) is the $180M research, instructional and entrepreneurial complex in which CEHC resides, providing our faculty state of the art laboratory and teaching spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CEHC seeks adjunct lecturers for the Department of Cybersecurity. Successful candidates will be able to teach undergraduate and graduate courses in one or ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199953\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199953 Adjunct Lecturer - Educational and Counseling Psychology, Division of Counseling Psychology - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201882 Faculty Educational & Counseling Psychology - 02305 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jun 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Department of Educational & Counseling Psychology is multidisciplinary and devoted to research, teaching, and service in the use of psychological principles to promote lifelong growth, learning, and development in multiple life roles and contexts.&nbsp;Four disciplines are represented in the department:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/counseling-psychology\" target=\"_blank\">Counseling Psycholog</a>y,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/educational-psychology-and-methodology\" target=\"_blank\">Educational Psychology and Methodology</a>,&nbsp;...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201882\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Thu, 25 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201882 Adjunct Lecturer - Emergency Management and Homeland Security (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199939 Faculty Homeland Security - 04041 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security and Cybersecurity (CEHC) is the first of its kind in the nation; uniting people, technology and knowledge to address the challenges of the 21st century. The Emerging Technology and Entrepreneurship Complex (ETEC) is the $180M research, instructional and entrepreneurial complex in which CEHC resides, providing our faculty state of the art laboratory and teaching spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CEHC seeks adjunct lecturers for the Department of Emergency Management and Homeland Security. Successful candidates will be able to teach courses in one o...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199939\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199939 Adjunct Lecturer - Game Design and Development (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199947 Faculty College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security & Cybersecurity - 02700 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security and Cybersecurity (CEHC) is the first of its kind in the nation; uniting people, technology and knowledge to address the challenges of the 21st century. The Emerging Technology and Entrepreneurship Complex (ETEC) is the $180M research, instructional and entrepreneurial complex in which CEHC resides, providing our faculty state of the art laboratory and teaching spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CEHC seeks adjunct lecturers for our new and growing Game Design & Development (GDD) program. The candidate will teach game design and development courses ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199947\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199947 Adjunct Lecturer - Information Sciences & Technology (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200565 Faculty Information Sciences & Technology - 04044 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri May 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security and Cybersecurity (CEHC) is the first of its kind in the nation; uniting people, technology and knowledge to address the challenges of the 21st century. ETEC is the $180M research, instructional and entrepreneurial complex in which CEHC resides, providing our faculty state of the art laboratory and teaching spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CEHC seeks adjunct lecturers for the Department of Information Sciences and Technology. Successful candidates will be able to teach undergraduate and graduate courses in one or more of the following subject are...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200565\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 15 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200565 Adjunct Lecturers, Integrated Health Science - Part-time (Continuous Posting) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=198639 Faculty College of Integrated Health Sciences - 02407 Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Mar 27 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Integrated Health Sciences (CIHS) at the University at Albany is seeking to hire part-time/adjunct lecturers for undergraduate and master-level&nbsp;courses in all Public Health disciplines, including but not limited to Global Health, Health Policy and Management, Social Behavior and Community Health, Maternal and Child Health, Epidemiology, Biostatistics, Health Communications, Environmental Health Science, and Public Health Preparedness. Applications will be accepted and reviewed on an ongoing basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Housed in the most diverse, public, Research 1 university in ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=198639\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 27 Mar 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=198639 Administrative Manager - Computer Science - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203335 Professional Computer Science - 02110 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 4 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Department of Computer Science, within the College of Nanotechnology, Science, and Engineering (CNSE), offers undergraduate and graduate degree programs supporting the University's mission in teaching, research, and service. The department administers complex academic programs, externally funded research activities, faculty affairs, graduate education, and student services while collaborating with numerous University administrative offices. The Administrative Manager plays a critical role in ensuring the effective operation of the department by overseeing fiscal, personnel, academic,...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203335\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203335 Administrative Manager - Department of Emergency Management & Homeland Security - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202589 Professional College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security & Cybersecurity - 02700 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Jul 14 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Emergency Preparedness, Homeland Security, and Cybersecurity (CEHC) at the University at Albany is hiring an Administrative Manager for the Emergency Management / Homeland Security department. The main role is to provide administrative support to help faculty be more effective in teaching and research by managing academic, fiscal, and personnel matters. The Administrative Manager will handle tasks that help the Chair, faculty, staff, and students work well together, as well as coordinate with University offices and outside agencies. The position will also connect the Dean'...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202589\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 14 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202589 AI Developer/Analyst - Information Technology Services - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203852 Professional Information Technology Services - 02007 Administrative and Professional Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 18 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Information Technology Services (ITS) is the centralized provider of campus technology for the University. The department manages robust project and service portfolios to deliver the infrastructure, systems, cybersecurity, and support services that enable teaching, research, and administrative operations across the UAlbany community. ITS partners with campus stakeholders to advance strategic priorities through innovation, secure and reliable technology, and data-informed decision making.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Information Technology Services (ITS), seeks applicants for an AI Developer/Analyst, for a ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203852\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203852 Artist Model (Part-Time) - Temp/Hourly - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201121 Civil Service Art & Art History - 02104 Education Hourly <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Civil Service <B> Job Type: </B> Hourly <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jun 3 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>Vacancy #:</strong>&nbsp;Various</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Apply by:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Open Until Filled</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Title:</strong>&nbsp;Artist Model (Temp/Hourly)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Location:</strong>&nbsp;Art & Art History</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Salary:&nbsp; </strong>$25&nbsp;Hourly</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Grade:</strong>&nbsp;PEF SG-NS</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hours:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Varies</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Duration:&nbsp;</strong>Temporary</p><a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201121\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201121 Assistant Athletic Director for Annual Giving, Great Dane Athletic Club - Major Gifts - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203204 Professional Major Gifts - 06016 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 30 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>As a member of the Division of University Advancement, the Assistant Athletic Director for Annual Giving is charged with contributing to the success of UAlbany's annual unrestricted gifts campaign, which has an overall goal of raising $6+ million in charitable donations from alumni, parents, friends, students, faculty, staff and corporations annually. This individual's primary responsibility is to increase philanthropic support for UAlbany by securing annual fund gifts through the Great Dane Athletic Club (GDAC), the membership-based annual giving program focused on UAlbany Athletics....<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203204\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203204 Assistant Director for Student Organizations - Student Engagement & Belonging - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199367 Professional Student Activities - 05011 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Apr 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director for Student Organizations plays a critical role in fostering a vibrant, inclusive, and engaging student life experience. This position advances the leadership development and organizational success of student organizations and Fraternity & Sorority Life communities by providing advising, training, and strategic resources. The Assistant Director collaborates closely with students, staff, and faculty to cultivate a campus environment that promotes civic engagement, collaboration, and community building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This role provides oversight and guidance to all Stude...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199367\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -050