ithin the Division of Student Affairs & Enrollment and of consists of...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203016\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 24 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203016 Associate Vice President for Facilities Management - Facilities Management - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203529 Professional Facilities Management - 03040 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Facilities Management within the Division of Finance & Administration supports three campuses spanning 515 acres and over 5.5 million gross square feet. The department is responsible for maintaining, constructing, renewing, and operating a safe, accessible, and sustainable physical environment aligned with the University's strategic mission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Associate Vice President (AVP) for Facilities provides strategic leadership and oversight for Facilities Management to provide a safe, beautiful and functional environment at the University at Albany. In addition, the AVP supervises mul...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203529\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203529 Bus Driver (Temporary Hourly) - Continuous Posting - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204390 Civil Service Parking & Mass Transit Services - 03018 Education Hourly <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Civil Service <B> Job Type: </B> Hourly <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Sep 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>Vacancy</strong>:&nbsp;Temporary Bus Driver</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Apply by</strong>:&nbsp;Continuous&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Title</strong>:&nbsp;Bus Driver</p>\r\n\r\n<p