 02001 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jun 18 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The incumbent will supervise the Academic Affairs Post Award Managers. In addition, this position is responsible for providing post-award grant, contract, and MOU management support. The position requires the ability to manage high volume and complex grant management support, working with Principal Investigators (PI), key personnel, collaborating institutions and administrative staff to ensure post-award activities are successfully executed. The incumbent will provide financial management of grant funds including expenditures and account balances, completing personnel forms, travel, purc...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201684\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Thu, 18 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201684 Professor and Chair - Department of Mechanical and Mechatronics Engineering (MME) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=193639 Faculty College of Nanotechnology, Science & Engineering, Dean's Office - 02508 Academic / Faculty Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Oct 6 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The College of Nanotechnology, Science, and Engineering (CNSE) at the University at Albany seeks a visionary and collaborative leader to serve as Associate or Full professor who will also serve as the founding Chair of the Department of Mechanical and Mechatronics Engineering (MME). This individual will provide academic, administrative, and strategic leadership for a growing department focused on cutting-edge education and research in mechanical, mechatronics, and design engineering. The Chair will play a critical role in faculty recruitment, program development, and fostering partnershi...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=193639\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 06 Oct 2025 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=193639 Program Manager - Office of Provost & VP- Academic Affairs - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203047 Professional Provost & VP- Academic Affairs - 02001 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Jul 27 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Project Manager provides leadership, coordination, and operational oversight for major academic events sponsored by the Office of the Provost. The position's primary responsibility is the planning and execution of Showcase, UAlbany's annual campus-wide celebration of student research, scholarship, and creative activity. Showcase is one of the university's largest academic events, involving extensive cross-campus collaboration and engaging thousands of students, faculty, staff, and community members. In 2026, Showcase featured more than 2,600 student participants delivering more than ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203047\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203047 Programming Coordinator - Student Engagement and Belonging - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199346 Professional Student Activities - 05011 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Apr 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Programming Coordinator for Student Activities plays a critical role in fostering a vibrant, inclusive, and engaging student life experience. This position enhances campus engagement by designing and implementing late-night, weekend, and large-scale programming that contributes to student connection, school spirit, and a strong sense of belonging. The Programming Coordinator collaborates closely with students, staff, and on/off-campus partners to create experiences that promote community building and meaningful involvement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong>Primary Responsibilities:</strong></u>...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199346\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199346 Regional Admissions Recruiter (4 Vacancies) - Admissions - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=191190 Professional Admissions - 02002 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Aug 1 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The University at Albany is seeking four dynamic and experienced Regional Admissions Recruiters to join its Undergraduate Admissions team. These part-time remote positions will represent the University in the following key recruitment regions:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Baltimore, MD / Washington D.C. Metro Area</li><li>South New Jersey / Philadelphia, PA Area</li><li>Detroit, MI Metro Area</li><li>Atlanta, GA Metro Area</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Each recruiter will serve as Albany's primary admissions representative in their designated region, working 20 hours per week year-round. Candidates must reside with...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=191190\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=191190 Research and Data Analyst - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199642 Professional Vice Pres for Student Affairs - 05001 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 21 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Division of Student Affairs & Enrollment seeks two Research and Data Analysts to lead and advance data management, analysis, reporting, and storytelling efforts across divisional priorities. The positions play a critical role in strengthening the division's ability to measure, understand, and communicate student impact across career outcomes, health and well-being, student engagement, belonging, and overall student success initiatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This role combines advanced data analysis, survey design, systems optimization, assessment support, and stakeholder-facing communication. Be...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199642\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199642 Residence Hall Director - Residential Life - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202113 Professional Residential Life - 05009 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 1 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Resident Hall Director (RD) is responsible for the administration of one or more residence halls housing between 200 and 450 students and actively supports the Department's mission by making them inviting, intellectual, and inclusive communities. The RD supervises 12 Resident Assistants. The RD shares in a weekly living area on-duty rotation and the departmental recess duty rotation. The RD is responsible for a specialty area (i.e. programming, staff development, or administrative) and is the liaison for this area for all student and professional staff in their living area.</p>\r\n\r\n...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202113\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202113 Senior Director Of Development, Massry School of Business - Major Gifts - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202901 Professional Major Gifts - 06016 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Since its founding in 1959, the Massry School of Business has been committed to providing high-quality, high-value business education to a diverse student population. As one of seven schools within the University at Albany - one of four university centers in the State University of New York (SUNY) system - the School serves approximately 2,284 undergraduate and 398 graduate students. Located in New York's Capital Region, the School is a recognized leader in business education and plays a vital role in advancing professional and management education regionally and globally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202901\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202901 Senior Research Associate - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=186413 Professional Youth Justice Best Practices - 02509 Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Professional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Mar 14 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>To help support our research and evaluation efforts, the New York State Youth Justice Institute (YJI) is seeking to hire a Senior Research Associate. The incumbent will work on a myriad of impactful, funded projects with a focus on evaluation and participatory research.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>About the New York State Youth Justice Institute (YJI)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The YJI's work focuses on providing training, technical assistance, research, and evaluation support to youth justice-related state agencies, local partners, and others who provide direct services to youth under 25. Our approach to...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=186413\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 14 Mar 2025 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=186413 Student Conduct Coordinator - Hearing Administrator - Community Standards - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204378 Promotional Community Standards - 05017 Other Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Promotional <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Sep 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Office of the Dean of Students provides Great Danes and their support network with inclusive, innovative, and impactful support services and education to promote successful scholarship through specialized resources, consultation, and, when appropriate, advocacy to help them navigate the University at Albany. Our Office serves as an umbrella for Community Standards (along with off-campus resources), Disability Access and Inclusion Student Services (DAISS), Supplemental Support Services, and Veteran and Military Student Services (VMSS).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We strive to improve equity through acc...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204378\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Wed, 16 Sep 2026 23:59:59 -0400 JOBID=204378 Trades Specialist (Electrician) (Electrical Shop) - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204417 Civil Service Electrical Shop - 03061 Education Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Civil Service <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Sep 3 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>Vacancy #:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>WF250096</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Apply by:&nbsp; </strong>September 14,