: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Civil Service <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 21 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>Apply by:&nbsp; </strong>Continuous Posting (Human Resources will canvass the Civil Service exam list when position(s) are open)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Title:</strong> University Police Officer 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Location: </strong>University Police Department</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Salary:&nbsp; </strong>$64,796</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Grade:</strong>&nbsp;PBANYS SG-14</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hours:&nbsp; </strong>TBD</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Duration:&nbsp; </strong>Contingent/Permanent</p><a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199666\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199666 Visiting Assistant Professor (Academic-year appointment) - Information Systems & Business Analytics - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202511 Faculty Information Systems & Business Analytics - 02207 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Jul 13 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Massry School of Business at the University at Albany is a dynamic, research-driven institution within a flagship public research university. We are AACSB-accredited in both business administration and accounting - a distinction held by fewer than 2% of business schools worldwide. Our faculty are active scholars who benefit from a collegial environment that values rigorous research, interdisciplinary collaboration, and meaningful engagement with industry and policy. The Massry School houses cutting-edge research centers including the Center for Institutional Investment Management (CI...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202511\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 13 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202511 Visiting Assistant Professor (Academic-year appointment), 2 Positions - Psychology - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202506 Faculty Psychology - 02131 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Jul 13 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The <a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/cas\" target=\"_blank\">College of Arts and Sciences</a> at the University at Albany, SUNY, is a diverse and vibrant community of exceptional scholars committed to excellence in the pursuit of knowledge, both for its own sake and in service to society. As the University's largest academic unit, the College spans 20 academic departments and 12 Institutes and Centers, in addition to the UAlbany in the High School Program and the Performing Arts Center and serves as the intellectual core of the University's teaching and research mission. The College encompas...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202506\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 13 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202506 Visiting Assistant Professor (Human Biology) - Anthropology - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201829 Faculty Anthropology - 02103 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jun 24 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The <a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/anthropology\" target=\"_blank\">Department of Anthropology</a> at the University at Albany, SUNY, within the College of Arts and Sciences is a dynamic, research-active unit within the College of Arts and Sciences dedicated to the interdisciplinary study of humanity across time and space. Anthropology at UAlbany examines the full range of human experience?from human evolution and ancient societies to contemporary cultures and global systems?through a holistic and comparative approach.&nbsp; The department is organized around the four core subfields of ant...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201829\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201829 Visiting Assistant Professor - Computer Science - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=194884 Faculty Computer Science - 02110 Academic / Faculty Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Nov 18 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Computer Science Department within the College of Nanotechnology, Science, and Engineering at the University at Albany, SUNY, is seeking applicants for a Visiting Assistant Professor of Computer Science for the 2026-2027 academic year, with the possibility of renewal for AY27-28.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The successful candidate is expected to develop an externally funded research program in computer science. In addition, the applicant will be responsible for teaching 2-4 courses per year at the undergraduate and graduate levels and participate in curriculum development. Specific teaching assignmen...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=194884\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 -0500 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=194884 Visiting Assistant Professor - Counseling Psychology - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202863 Faculty Counseling Psychology - 02306 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/department-educational-counseling-psychology\" target=\"_blank\">Department of Educational & Counseling Psycholog</a>y&nbsp;at the School of Education, UAlbany, is multidisciplinary and devoted to research, teaching, and service in the use of psychological principles to promote lifelong growth, learning, and development in multiple life roles and contexts. Four disciplines are represented in the department:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/counseling-psychology\" target=\"_blank\">Counseling Psychology</a>,&nbsp;...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202863\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202863 Visiting Assistant Professor - Electrical and Computer Engineering - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=197520 Faculty Electrical & Computer Engineering - 02527 Academic / Faculty Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Feb 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering within the College of Nanotechnology, Science, and Engineering at the University at Albany, SUNY, is seeking applicants for a Visiting Assistant Professor of Electrical and Computer Engineering for the 2026-2027 academic year, with the possibility of renewal for AY27-28.<br>\r\nThe successful candidate is expected to be able to teach undergraduate and graduate courses in the computing area. The applicant will be responsible for teaching 2-6 courses per year, with those working to develop a research program teaching fewer courses and tho...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=197520\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 25 Feb 2026 00:00:00 -0500 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=197520 Visiting Assistant Professor - Information Security & Digital Forensics - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201040 Faculty Information Security & Digital Forensics - 02216 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Jun 1 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>About the position:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Information Security and Digital Forensics Department at the Massry School of Business, University at Albany, State University of New York, invites applications for a non-tenure track Visiting Assistant Professor of Information Security and Digital Forensics position, beginning Fall 2026. This&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;one-year temporary appointment, with possible extensions up to two additional years, subject to successful review and university approval.&nbsp;The position has a 3/3 teaching load and includes both in-person and online teaching...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201040\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201040 Visiting Assistant Professor - Scenic Design - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=190889 Faculty Music and Theatre - 02126 Academic / Faculty Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Jul 25 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The University at Albany (SUNY) Theatre Program seeks a Visiting Assistant Professor of Scenic Design for the Fall 2025 semester (an August 14, 2025 start date with classes beginning August 25, 2025) to design two productions a year for our season and teach classes in our undergraduate program. The Performing Arts Center in which we are housed contains five theatres, and a fully equipped scene shop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a one-year appointment, with the possibility of second and third-year renewals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Start Date: 8/14/2025</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Salary: $50,000.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><u>...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=190889\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Fri, 25 Jul 2025 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=190889 Visiting Assistant Professor - School Psychology Program - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202884 Faculty School Psychology Program - 02308 Academic / Faculty Full-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/department-educational-counseling-psychology\" target=\"_blank\">Department of Educational & Counseling Psycholog</a>y&nbsp;at the School of Education, UAlbany, is multidisciplinary and devoted to research, teaching, and service in the use of psychological principles to promote lifelong growth, learning, and development in multiple life roles and contexts. Four disciplines are represented in the department:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.albany.edu/education/counseling-psychology\" target=\"_blank\">Counseling Psychology</a>,&nbsp;...<a href=\"http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202884\"> more...</a> Albany, NY Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202884 Visiting Assistant Professor in Computer Science - University at Albany http://albany.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=189372 Faculty Computer Science - 02110 Academic / Faculty Full-time <b> Location: </b> Albany, NY <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jun 18 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Computer Science Department within the College of Nanotechnology, Science, and Engineering at the University at Albany, SUNY, is seeking applicants for a full-time, Visiting Lecturer position to begin Fall 2025. The position is for the